---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms and Conditions of HabitTrack — free, client-side, local-first monthly habit tracking application."
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <!-- Hero Card -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/60 text-indigo-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-indigo-100 dark:border-purple-800/60 mb-4">
        <span>📜</span>
        <span>Legal Terms</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-50 tracking-tight">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80">
        Last modified: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Card -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-purple-100/90 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          By accessing, using, or installing the HabitTrack web application ("the Application"), you agree to abide by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not accept these terms, you should discontinue using the Application.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-purple-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">2. Free Personal License</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          HabitTrack is granted to you free of charge for personal self-improvement, productivity tracking, and organizational purposes. You may use the web app online or install it offline as a Progressive Web App (PWA).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-purple-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">3. Local Data Responsibility</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          Because HabitTrack operates exclusively offline without remote cloud servers, all your records are saved inside your device's browser IndexedDB.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300/90">
          <li>We do not possess or maintain backups of your habits or logs.</li>
          <li>Clearing browser storage or browsing in private/incognito mode will erase or fail to persist your logs.</li>
          <li>You are solely responsible for managing your device storage and browser data.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-purple-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          The Application is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind. We make no guarantees that the application will be uninterrupted, error-free, or compatible with every browser version or operating system.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-purple-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          In no event shall the authors or maintainers of HabitTrack be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use of or inability to use this software.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
